<!-- Cookies Policy -->
<div id="popup-cookies" class="popup-overlay">
    <div class="popup-content">
        <button class="popup-close">&times;</button>
        <h2>Política de Cookies</h2>
        <div class="popup-body">
            <p>Last updated: April 11, 2026</p>
            <h2 id="what-are-cookies">1. What are cookies?</h2>
            <p>Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device when you visit a website. They are used to improve the user experience, analyze site traffic, and remember preferences.</p>
            <h2 id="what-types-of-cookies-do-we-use">2. What types of cookies do we use?</h2>
            <p>At <strong>evaristocuesta.com</strong>, we only use <strong>analytics cookies</strong>, specifically those from <strong>Google Analytics</strong>. These cookies help us understand how visitors interact with our website, collecting information anonymously.</p>
            <h3 id="google-analytics-cookies"><strong>Google Analytics Cookies</strong></h3>
            <p>These cookies allow us to collect data such as the number of visitors, most viewed pages, and time spent on the site. The information collected is completely anonymous and does not allow us to personally identify users.</p>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Name</th>
                        <th>Provider</th>
                        <th>Purpose</th>
                        <th>Duration</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>_ga</td>
                        <td>Google Analytics</td>
                        <td>Distinguish unique users</td>
                        <td>1 year</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>_gid</td>
                        <td>Google Analytics</td>
                        <td>Differentiate sessions</td>
                        <td>24 hours</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>_gat</td>
                        <td>Google Analytics</td>
                        <td>Limit request rate</td>
                        <td>1 minute</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <h2 id="how-to-manage-cookies">3. How to manage cookies?</h2>
            <p>You can accept or reject analytics cookies in the cookie banner when you access our website. You can also configure your browser to block or delete cookies at any time. Below, we provide links to cookie management in the main browsers:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647?hl=en" target="_blank">Google Chrome</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/clear-cookies-and-site-data-firefox" target="_blank">Mozilla Firefox</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-gb/help/4027947/microsoft-edge-delete-cookies" target="_blank">Microsoft Edge</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/en-gb/105082" target="_blank">Safari</a></li>
            </ul>
            <h2 id="changes-to-the-cookies-policy">4. Changes to the Cookies Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this policy at any time to reflect changes in legislation or in our use of cookies. We recommend that you review it periodically.</p>
            <p>If you have questions about our Cookies Policy, you can contact us through <a href="mailto:contact@evaristocuesta.com"><strong>contact@evaristocuesta.com</strong></a>.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
